<title>SPAIN: Spain may release '97 economic forecasts Friday.</title>
<headline>Spain may release '97 economic forecasts Friday.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish Economy Minister Rodrigo Rato may release the government's 1997 economic forecasts on Friday at a news conference expected after the cabinet approves the budget, a spokesman for the Economy Ministry said.</p>
<p>Rato is also scheduled to give a news conference on Monday, at 0730 GMT, after presenting the budget to parliament. He will provide details of the draft bill at the time, the spokesman said.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
